Engineering standards

Struxure implements design verification procedures described in the following
standards. It reproduces none of their text.

  AISC 360, Specification for Structural Steel Buildings
  American Institute of Steel Construction

  ACI 318, Building Code Requirements for Structural Concrete
  American Concrete Institute

Struxure is not affiliated with, endorsed by, sponsored by, or approved by the
American Institute of Steel Construction or the American Concrete Institute.
Neither organisation has reviewed, verified, or certified this software or its
results. AISC and ACI, and the titles of their publications, are the property of
their respective owners.

Section property values are physical properties of standard rolled shapes.
Users requiring authoritative values must consult the current edition of the
governing standard.

